#
# 4. Build trim (measured on 53679a5, -j24: Image+modules+dtbs 458 s -> 260 s
#    wall, 1410 -> 312 modules). Reviewed per area against what a Raze runs:
#    the camera path, the USB gadget and host (storage, UVC, Ethernet and
#    serial adapters, CAN, HID and gamepads), bridge/macb/IPv6 with a basic
#    nftables firewall, I2C/PIO/PWM/fan/watchdog/spidev/GPIO, vc4/v3d,
#    erofs/ext4/vfat/exfat/squashfs/overlay, NVMe, device-mapper, zram and
#    what systemd needs. linux/check-config.sh fails the build if any of
#    these comes back because something selects it.
#
# --- Networking and crypto ---
