# i2c, spi, mtd, misc, leds, regulator, pwm and the rest of the =m groups outside the
# net/crypto/sound/gpu/media/staging/hid/input/video/fs owners, plus KVM and debug/tracing
# options that only cost build time. Applied on top of bcm2712_defconfig + raze.config.
#
# USB gadget: legacy g_* modules and functions the Raze never binds (configfs ECM/NCM/RNDIS/ACM/mass storage kept)
